#: ../../functions/func_while.rst:6
msgid "$while"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_while.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$while(condition,code)**"
msgstr "用法：**$while(condition,code)**"

#: ../../functions/func_while.rst:9
msgid "Category: loop"
msgstr "类别：循环"

#: ../../functions/func_while.rst:10
msgid "Implemented: Picard 2.3"
msgstr "实现：Picard 2.3"

#: ../../functions/func_while.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_while.rst:14
msgid "Executes ``code`` repeatedly until ``condition`` no longer evaluates to True. For each loop, the count is stored in the variable ``_loop_count``. This allows the count value to be accessed within the ``code`` script."
msgstr ""
"``code`` 会反复执行，直到 ``condition`` 不再评估为 True。每次循环，计数存储在"
"变量 ``_loop_count`` 中。这允许在 ``code`` 脚本中访问计数值。"

#: ../../functions/func_while.rst:18
msgid "The function limits the maximum number of iterations to 1000 as a safeguard against accidentally creating an infinite loop."
msgstr "该函数将最大迭代次数限制为 1000，以防止意外创建无限循环。"

#: ../../functions/func_while.rst:21
msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

#: ../../functions/func_while.rst:23
